  (text "05_Stack_Header J1  [zone: lower-centre, HORIZONTAL 10x2 strip]
2x10 2.54mm header -- the ONLY inter-board path -- laid horizontal between the
nav buttons (above) and the USB-C (below) so nothing fights for the centre.
PIN GROUPING (deliberate): power on the ends; SPI block on the pins nearest the
shield SPI spine; I2C block near the PN532 side; UART block near C5/RV1106 side.
Same X/Y on BOTH boards." (at 15 15 0)
